#: ../../../index.md:17
msgid ""
"PyGMT is a library for processing geospatial and geophysical data and making "
"publication-quality maps and figures. It provides a Pythonic interface for "
"the [Generic Mapping Tools (GMT)](https://www.generic-mapping-tools.org/), a "
"command-line program widely used across the Earth, Ocean, and Planetary "
"sciences and beyond."
msgstr ""

